#: content/guides.ts
msgid "Podcasts are the worst case for per-minute pricing: long episodes, two or three faces, and a lot of 'um' between the good parts. Reelsaw was built around that shape: it chunks long transcripts without losing the middle, stacks speakers when it cannot pick one, and cuts fillers with cuts it has checked."
